# 2. HOW TO USE

## STEP 1

Create folder:

```txt
art-books-store
```

---

## STEP 2

Inside folder create:

```txt
index.html
```

Paste the HTML code.

---

## STEP 3

Replace:

```txt
IMAGE_URL_HERE
```

with Canva or Google Photos image.

Example:

```txt
https://photos.app.goo.gl/RC2xLTT54CdoYAvH9
```

---

## STEP 4

Replace:

```txt
STRIPE_URL_HERE
```

with Stripe payment URL.

Example:

```txt
https://buy.stripe.com/4gM00kdm01kmctDgpVcjS01
```

---

## STEP 5

Change coupon number:

```txt
art&books.w.c/N° ITMK001
```

Example:

```txt
art&books.w.c/N° ITMK163
```

